    "detailed_description": "<strong>You are a bug, and bugs gotta eat. Work with your friends to find and eat enough food to survive, or simply eat your friends to survive. </strong><br><br>You Are Bugs is a multiplayer PvP bug game, Predators vs Prey. As a Prey bug, you must work with your fellow bugs to collect food and return it to the nest. Various species like Ants, Flies, and Snails offer different strategies, but teamwork is required to succeed. <br><br>As a Predator, your goal is simple. Find and hunt down the Prey before they collect enough food and burrow into the nest for good. Species such as the Spider and Wasp hunt effectively on their own, but are extremely dangerous when coordinating.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be A Bug</h2>Climb on anything and everything in your pursuit of food. Bugs have sticky feet, so nearly every surface in the game can be traversed. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/da21f35dc8cbe1f2fa43c75ab551743e.poster.avif?t=1707431127\" width=420 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/da21f35dc8cbe1f2fa43c75ab551743e.webm?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/da21f35dc8cbe1f2fa43c75ab551743e.mp4?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Food</h2>All bugs need food to survive. Some eat poop, some eat other bugs. Which are you?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/a8ba67f042a50b85ae8171ac027ca158.poster.avif?t=1707431127\" width=420 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/a8ba67f042a50b85ae8171ac027ca158.webm?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/a8ba67f042a50b85ae8171ac027ca158.mp4?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Together</h2>The life of one individual ant does not matter. What matters is the colony. Rally with your fellow bugs!<br><br>",
