58.webm?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668610/extras/a8ba67f042a50b85ae8171ac027ca158.mp4?t=1707431127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Together</h2>The life of one individual ant does not matter. What matters is the colony. Rally with your fellow bugs!<br><br>",
